result: 'Store/wal artifacts removed from tree (already gitignored, none tracked).
  Clippy made a hard CI gate via `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`. Fixed
  all clippy issues: 1 deny-by-default approx_constant error in lexer/tests.rs; ~745
  auto-fixed via clippy --fix (clone_on_copy, collapsible_if, redundant_closure, etc);
  ~39 manual fixes (nonminimal_bool, useless_conversion, match→matches!, redundant_locals,
  duplicated_attributes, needless_range_loop, doc list formatting); scoped #[allow]
  for genuine false-positives (only_used_in_recursion, type_complexity, too_many_arguments,
  intentional if_same_then_else). All 1626 tests pass, zero clippy warnings.'
description: 'Quick wins. (1) Ensure *.store/*.wal are git-ignored (verify already
  done) and remove any tracked artifacts from the tree. (2) Guarantee clippy actually
  runs in CI (ci/ + .github/). Definition of done: no store/wal artifacts tracked;
  clippy job present and passing in CI config.'
